  "_about": "a least weasel SCULPTED on its rig (2026-11-06, gen: scratchpad sc/must/weasel.py): 20 cm nose to rump and a 4.5 cm tail, a long thin tube of a body on short legs, a long neck as thick as the small flat head; small round ears set low, black bead eyes, a short muzzle with whiskers. Russet brown above, white below -- the upper lip, chin, throat, chest and belly -- the line between them crisp and a little wavy (the `weasel` pattern, coatpat.js weaselOf); the short tail brown to its end (a black tip would make it a stoat) (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): small round cupped sheets (sharp.js `fin`); the roots faired. WHISKERS (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sharp/whiskers.py): 9 @whisker-coloured whiskers a side, 3 rows on the whisker pad (18-28 mm) -- `whiskers` shapes (bodyspec.js whiskerStrands: thin pointed strands, mirrored, on the head, near mesh only; details, so every coat and variant still shares one mesh), replacing the hand-placed cones.",
